{"id":"n14505-1-7","stage":1,"title":"보라색 · 紫色","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14505-1-7-1","ko":"네 혓바닥이 왜 보라색으로 변했니?","zh":"你的舌头为什么变成紫色了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네","meaning":"“너의(你的)”的缩略语。","explanation":"네：“너의(你的)”的缩略语。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84427","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"혓바닥이","meaning":"舌面","explanation":"혓바닥：舌面；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"혓바닥","audio":"/audio/8e646cbe3a7df0db915c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85697","senseId":"1","lemma":"혓바닥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보라색으로","meaning":"紫色","explanation":"보라색：紫色；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"보라색","audio":"/audio/aa4155165c4852a943b9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14505","senseId":"1","lemma":"보라색","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"변했니?","meaning":"变，改变，变成","explanation":"변하다：变，改变，变成；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"변하다","audio":"/audio/35e71a5db7e3493cf6ff.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58881","senseId":"1","lemma":"변하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"“너의(你的)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"84427","definition":"“너의(你的)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"8e646cbe3a7df0db","term":"혓바닥","zh":"舌面","audio":"/audio/8e646cbe3a7df0db915c.mp3","entryId":"85697","definition":"舌头表面。","pronunciation":["혀빠닥","혇빠닥"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"aa4155165c4852a9","term":"보라색","zh":"紫色","audio":"/audio/aa4155165c4852a943b9.mp3","entryId":"14505","definition":"蓝色和红色混合而成的颜色。","pronunciation":["보라색"]},{"id":"35e71a5db7e3493c","term":"변하다","zh":"变，改变，变成","audio":"/audio/35e71a5db7e3493cf6ff.mp3","entryId":"58881","definition":"成为其他东西或性质发生变动。","pronunciation":["변ː하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ba8ceb60fa86a5af193b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14505-1-7-2","ko":"조금 전에 포도를 먹었더니 그렇게 됐나 봐.","zh":"应该是刚才吃了葡萄才变成这样的吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"조금","meaning":"片刻，一会儿","explanation":"조금：片刻，一会儿","readings":[{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61176","senseId":"2","lemma":"조금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"전에","meaning":"前","explanation":"전：前；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"전","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17301","senseId":"2","lemma":"전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"포도를","meaning":"葡萄","explanation":"포도：葡萄；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"포도","audio":"/audio/0f7706d92c4d69b9de0c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62808","senseId":"1","lemma":"포도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹었더니","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；더니：根据先前观察的情况，引出后来的变化、结果或对比。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"됐나","meaning":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","explanation":"되다：变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"16","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"b4049b7414b62d9b","term":"조금","zh":"片刻，一会儿","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3","entryId":"61176","definition":"短暂时间。","pronunciation":["조금"]},{"id":"d9f427c3257e81e0","term":"전","zh":"前","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3","entryId":"17301","definition":"比一定时期早。","pronunciation":["전"]},{"id":"0f7706d92c4d69b9","term":"포도","zh":"葡萄","audio":"/audio/0f7706d92c4d69b9de0c.mp3","entryId":"62808","definition":"由甜美而微酸的小果实结成一串的紫色水果。","pronunciation":["포도"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ae2a984652603705a600.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.025,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14505","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":58,"sequenceScore":2.7503,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["应该是刚才吃了葡萄才变成这样的吧。","你的舌头为什么变成紫色了？","昨天在幼儿园做的志愿活动真的非常有趣。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你的舌头为什么变成紫色了？","昨天在幼儿园做的志愿活动真的非常有趣。","应该是刚才吃了葡萄才变成这样的吧。"],"answer":2}]}
